+- **Stars:** 34.8k ⭐
+- **Language:** Python
+- **License:** BSD-3-Clause
+- **Last Commit:** 2024-04-02
+- **Category:** upscaling, restoration
+- **Best for:** enlarging low-resolution photos and restoring noisy real-world images
+
